  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hi9moJH.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><strong>&laquo; 模组兼容性 v3.10.1 &raquo;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>社区贡献同样欢迎！只需&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/pulls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交 PR</a>，您的 UI 界面即可加入该资源包，并将获得完整署名。</em></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>您也可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fNtwzA6X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a> 上寻求支持或报告问题。</em></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><em><strong>&laquo; 查看 STONEBORN 资源包（必需） &raquo;</strong></em></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/stoneborn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/673/ui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"156\" height=\"156\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">&laquo; 700万 &raquo; 次下载！衷心感谢大家。已入选 &laquo; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval MC [FABRIC]</a> &raquo;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/medieval-mc-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/489/55/medievallogo.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"76\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" height=\"32\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">.fsh 着色器。现在所有 GUI 标题和容器标题均为橙色/金色。实现最大兼容性！</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">如果您更喜欢默认文本而非金色文本，请删除 .fsh 着色器文件</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hOSFIUm.png\" width=\"274\" height=\"390\"></span>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><em>请尽情体验 STONEBORN 为 200 多款模组提供的重绘材质，包括 Create、Quark、JEI、REI、AE2、Biomancy、Sophisticated Backpacks、Iron Chests、Curios、Trinkets 以及更多！</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">请在评论区或 <a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a> 上提交添加请求。</span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/417/339/line.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">&laquo; 支持的模组 &raquo;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<em>如需完整的受支持模组列表 --&gt;<strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/vizthex123/StonebornModdedCompat/blob/main/CFAssets/supported_mods.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>. </strong>&lt;--</em></p>\n\n<ol>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorn-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;装饰&nbsp;</span></span></span></a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;亚历克斯的生物&nbsp;</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alloy-forgery\" rel=\"nofollow\">合金锻造</a>&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;神化&nbsp;</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;苹果皮&nbsp;</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-energistics-2\" rel=\"nofollow\">应用能源2</a>&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https:/